# Normalize to LF in the repository; check out with the platform's native endings.
# Existing blobs stay as they are until a file is next touched, so this migrates gradually.
# To convert everything in one commit instead: git add --renormalize . && git commit
* text=auto

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
